    "final": "Size L \u2014 size up. The store gives no fit data for the Wexcombe tee: all 45 'Wexcombe Midweight Jersey Tee' listings (Fairhaven Apparel, Whitlock Outfitters, etc.) offer only standard sizes XS\u2013XXL, with no size chart, measurements, fit notes, description, or customer reviews on any listing (verified on product pages and via the store's GraphQL API for all 45 products). Since the store cannot tell you the tee runs big or small, standard tee-sizing convention applies: if you are between a medium and a large, M will tend to be snug across the chest/shoulders and L gives the comfortable, relaxed fit a midweight jersey tee is meant to have \u2014 so L fits you better unless you deliberately want a trim fit. Practical note: on the top search result (Fairhaven Apparel, IGR-TCL-23), both M and L are currently out of stock (only XS/S/XL are buyable there); most other listings (e.g., Westmere Textile, Gisburn Garments, Holbeck Clothing, Marlow Garments) do have M and L in stock, so order the L from one of those.",
